{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想找出 Mac 硬碟空間被甚麼佔用，卻不想逐層翻找資料夾，Anillo 會把整個啟動磁碟化成互動環形圖表，讓你快速看清每個資料夾的大小。它適合容量經常告急的 Mac 用戶，原價 US $5.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>環形圖表看清硬碟空間</h2>\n<p>Anillo 以互動環形圖表呈現 Mac 啟動磁碟的完整結構，最大資料夾對應最大扇形，一眼看出空間被誰佔用。點擊扇形可逐層放大，側欄同時列出精確大小、百分比與檔案數量；掃描記錄會比對前後兩次結果，顯示哪些檔案新增、消失或改變大小，並可按檔案類型篩選及在 Finder 顯示項目。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/800x500bb.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/800x500bb-1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/800x500bb-2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/800x500bb-3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/800x500bb-4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/800x500bb-5.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Anillo: Disk Space Analyzer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T16:58:09.439905+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}